# Zhipu GLM Vision API Key Configuration
# =================================
# Required. Copy this file to `.env` in the same directory and fill in your key.
# Or set the GLM_VISION_API_KEY environment variable instead.
#
# Get a key at: https://open.bigmodel.cn/  (format: xxxxx.yyyyy)
#
# Format:
GLM_VISION_API_KEY=your_zhipu_api_key_here
